le0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 제출대상자 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011년 8월 대학원(일반, 산업 및 교육) 학위수여예정자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 대학원 박사과정 학위수여예정자 학위논문 학술지 게재 실적제출&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; ￭ 제출논문 조건 :&nbsp;재학 중 학생명의(공동연구자포함)로 해외저명 학술지에&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1편 이상 또는 국내 전국 규모 학술지에 2편 이상 게재된 논문&nbsp;\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; ￭ 게재된 경우 : 논문 별쇄본 1부. </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; ￭ 게재 예정인 경우 : 게재(예정)증명서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;(게재예정일자가 논문심사완료일(2011.06.17)이전 일것</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 113.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -113.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 05. 02(월) ~ 05. 06(금) 20:00</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출장소 : 대학원지원팀 (본관 302호)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 논문심사료 납부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 05. 02(월) ~ 05. 06(금) 20:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 논문심사료 : 박사과정 300,000원, 석사과정 100,000원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 납부장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">대학원지원팀 (본관 302호)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 논문심사 신청서 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 05. 02(월) ~ 05. 06(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 논문심사신청서 1부. (첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② 지도교수추천서 1부. (첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 심사용 논문(석사 : 3부, 박사 : 5부) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;④ 논문심사료 납입영수증(원본 또는 사본 제출) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">⑤ 학위논문 연구윤리 준수 확인서 1부.(첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">다. 제출장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5. 학위논문 심사기간 : 2011. 05. 18(수) ~ 06. 17(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 논문발표 등 학과별 심사일정은 학과(전공)별 기준에 따름 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">6.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학위논문 완성본 제출 (제출양식 등 세부사항은 추후 공고) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;◦ 완성논문 제출기간 : 2011. 07. 18(월) ~ 07. 21(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&